  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Projecto AVANTE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overal Objective: Contribute to the reduction of violence based on sexual orientation, gender identity and expression in Mozambique by stepping up efforts to prevent and combat discrimination, stigma and harassment against LGBTIQ + hate speech and hate crimes and discriminatory laws and practices that criminalize consensual same-sex relations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objective: Strengthen efforts to prevent and combat discrimination and stigma against LGBTIQ + people. Expected results: 1. Empowered and informed beneficiary communities on LGBTIQ + rights; 2. Prejudices and stigmas in relation to SOGIE reduced; 3. Empowered basic service ombudsmen on LGBTIQ + rights and inclusion; 4. Community, religious and traditional leaders involved as LGBTIQ + rights champions; 5. Community-based community safe spaces to ensure security, inclusion and support for victims of violence based on sexual orientation, identity and gender expression.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
